Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:04.44,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Well, apparently I've discovered that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:07.52,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I can take these yawn-filled days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.48,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And turn them into movies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:13.49,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I've found the secret and trick to it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.45,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Under this sky where we don't get along
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:19.54,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I closed my heart and locked it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:22.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That's how I've managed to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.58,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And the melodies now overlap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:31.34,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I wanted a sign, no matter how small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:38.26,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,That I could actually find \Nbetter than any streetlight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:45.14,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I put a ribbon on each of the \Nsights that my eyes pick out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:51.07,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,And I collect them like souvenirs \Nas I continue down this path home
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.07,0:00:57.07,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,The seasons each say hello, \Nand I shed a few tears as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:01:03.33,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,Where should I begin to talk about \Nthis way home that you've given me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:11.46,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I walk and walk and sometimes \Nrush on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:23.64,italicstop,OP,0,0,0,,I run and run, wait, no, I should \Nstill walk on my way to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:35.99,sign_8129_90_3_Days_Later,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\an9\pos(570,75)\fad(528,1)}Sometime\N Last\N Month
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:35.98,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,We came to an official agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:38.71,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,It'll be executed next month, on the 10th.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:41.02,flashback,Subordinate,0,0,0,,Sir, I offer my condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:45.62,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,"Sir," eh? You won't have to \Ncall me that much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.77,flashback,Subordinate,0,0,0,,The Desmond Group...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:49.22,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,You needn't say anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:50.62,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,Can't fight the times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:54.37,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,Our business was basically a \Ncandle flickering in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:58.88,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,What am I going to tell my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:01.50,flashback,George's Father,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:04.74,flashbacktop,George's Father,0,0,0,,our Glooman Pharmaceuticals company \Nwill cease to be in less than a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:05.89,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(327,285)\fscx66\fad(527,1)}A REVENGE PLOT AGAINST DESMOND
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:14.41,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Everything feels so much more peaceful \Nnow that our tests are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:18.90,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I didn't get any Tonitrus Bolts, \Nso Papa is also at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:22.66,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, is my sweet Loid pretty strict?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:25.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa is a monster when \Nit comes to the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He's a perfectionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:32.29,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I see. I guess it can be pretty rough when \Na parent's expectations are so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:32.83,main,Becky,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:35.83,main,Becky,0,0,0,,My sweet Loid sounds like \Nan amazing monster, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.10,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Desmond-Style...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:42.44,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Rolling... Sweep!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:49.64,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Well played, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.91,0:02:52.11,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Our school is cleaner already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.11,0:02:55.70,main,Student A,0,0,0,,Wow, Damian. I guess you're \Namazing at cleaning, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.38,main,Student A,0,0,0,,You spun around so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:03:00.31,main,Student B,0,0,0,,Kids who get Stella through sheer \Ntalent are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.29,main,Damian,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:04.49,main,Student C,0,0,0,,Hey, we should have a study session
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:08.70,main,Student C,0,0,0,,at Damian's place next break to \Nget to know each other better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.71,top,Student D,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.71,0:03:11.27,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Ugh! They're so dumb, \Nshowering him with praise like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:14.57,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm impressed with his test results, \Nbut he's still a huge brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:17.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I would also like to study \Nat Second Son's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:24.29,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Say... Is that really what's \Ngoing on with you and him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,With me and him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:29.18,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for calling him a huge brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:30.46,italics,George,0,0,0,,I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:36.43,top,Emile,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, please observe my Fire \NStrong Axel Final Strong Dust Pan, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.79,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hey, would you boys stop playing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:36.43,italics,George,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you, Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.69,italics,George,0,0,0,,I will never, ever forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.80,main,George,0,0,0,,I've brought you a dust pan, Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.44,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:44.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:45.94,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh? George?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:49.42,main,Becky,0,0,0,,George Glooman. He's in our class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:52.46,italics,George,0,0,0,,How... How did he get a Stella?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.36,italics,George,0,0,0,,The plan has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:04:00.14,italics,George,0,0,0,,I even had my butler hire a spy to change \Nall of his test results to failing scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.14,0:04:05.09,flashback,George,0,0,0,,This is three months' worth of my allowance.\N Hire an amazing spy with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:06.56,flashback,Butler,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.00,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,There's a spy boss in our class?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:13.53,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,So the spy Papa fought the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:17.91,main,Becky,0,0,0,,So, hey. More importantly, \Nwhat do you like about Damian?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:21.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is curious about that guy. Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:25.58,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh? No way. Are you, like, \Nokay with any guy, Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:30.07,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Don't bother with that guy.\NHe's so, well, gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:32.40,italics,George,0,0,0,,No, don't give up yet, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:35.16,italics,George,0,0,0,,If you can force him to get expelled...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:38.41,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,He's trying to get Second Son expelled?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.41,0:04:40.43,italics,George,0,0,0,,Not all hope is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:42.22,main,George,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.80,main,George,0,0,0,,This is a cigarette butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:49.22,main,George,0,0,0,,Damian... don't tell me {\i1}you{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.80,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What? I've never even smoked before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:54.58,main,George,0,0,0,,Sir, I need you right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.06,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! I told you it's not mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:05.12,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:06.53,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:11.30,main,George,0,0,0,,I was trying to report the cigarette \NI found, and then he punched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:12.24,main,George,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:12.85,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:16.00,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,What?! Explain yourself, Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.17,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,If this is true, you're in a lot of trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:21.02,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Lord Damian would never \Ndo anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:22.97,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,He's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:27.67,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Y-You two are Damian's followers. \NI can't trust your word against his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:32.10,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Second Son wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya was watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:36.35,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He just fell down on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:39.02,italics,Teacher,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.62,italics,Teacher,0,0,0,,It's like her eyes see through everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:46.23,italics,Teacher,0,0,0,,Sh-She's the girl who got a Tonitrus Bolt\N on the first day of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:48.74,italics,Teacher,0,0,0,,Oh, no. She's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:51.69,italics,Teacher,0,0,0,,My thirty years as a teacher \Nare telling me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:55.11,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,D-Don't go trying to bother your \Nteacher with your silly games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.11,0:05:57.44,main,Teacher,0,0,0,,Get back to cleaning. Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:59.16,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:03.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh. I can't let you get expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.33,0:06:04.63,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Plan B will be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:10.17,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Y-You were so cool, Anya! \NEven I felt like squeeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Squee?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:14.52,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm sure your feelings \Ngot through to Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:18.39,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What?! Wh-Wh-Wh-What the heck \Nare you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:21.09,main,Damian,0,0,0,,No one asked you to help! \NI coulda handled it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:23.56,main,George,0,0,0,,Yeah! Why did you get in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:24.23,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:28.08,main,Damian,0,0,0,,More importantly, who the \Nhell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.60,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:31.30,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What do you have against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:35.57,main,George,0,0,0,,Damn it! It's no use! My life is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:36.30,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:40.28,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Your family's company went bankrupt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.56,main,George,0,0,0,,That's right! Today, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:47.66,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? That's really unfortunate and all, \Nbut I have nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:51.71,main,George,0,0,0,,Your company is the one that crushed mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:52.52,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.68,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,I-I guess I did hear something \Nabout the Desmond Group
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:59.69,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,and Glooman Pharmaceuticals on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:04.19,main,George,0,0,0,,If you had failed your \Ntests and gotten expelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:08.84,main,George,0,0,0,,I thought the ensuing chaos in your family \Nmight've kept our company from going bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.34,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Crushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:13.33,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Father's company would never \Ndo something so evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:16.33,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Don't try to drag me into these \Nadult matters in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.88,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:21.42,main,George,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.75,main,George,0,0,0,,But as things stand, I'll be forced to leave \Nthe school because of some dumb adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:27.84,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What? You're quitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:33.20,main,George,0,0,0,,If I can't stop the company from \Ngoing bankrupt, my family will lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:36.14,main,George,0,0,0,,Which means I'll obviously have \Nto say goodbye to this school, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:42.96,main,George,0,0,0,,I envy you, Damian. You've been blessed \Nwith a good family, and you're popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.50,main,George,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course{\i0} you'd get Stellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:48.39,main,George,0,0,0,,You've nothing in common with filth like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:52.06,main,Emile,0,0,0,,L-Lord Damian got his Stella \Nbecause he's talented!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.68,main,Emile,0,0,0,,His family's got nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:57.82,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's your own fault \Nthat you're not popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.61,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,It's because you're a gloomy jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:00.72,main,George,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:01.40,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.16,main,Anya,0,0,0,,The groupies are shitheads, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:08.04,main,George,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut your mouths! \NYou could never understand how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:12.54,main,George,0,0,0,,I wanted to experience my youth \Nto the fullest in this school, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:16.38,main,George,0,0,0,,But even that turned into a fleeting dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:21.25,main,George,0,0,0,,If I'm bowing out after this, why am I even \Nbothering with cleaning this courtyard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:25.94,main,George,0,0,0,,Isn't there something wrong with filth \Nlike me picking up this filth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.19,main,George,0,0,0,,I see how it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:31.29,main,Damian,0,0,0,,No one said anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:32.51,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:37.40,main,George,0,0,0,,Damn it all! I'm going to curse this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:41.74,main,Damian,0,0,0,,C-Come on, cheer up. I'll buy \Nyou some juice or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:44.99,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Er, I guess you probably \Nwouldn't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:45.81,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:48.03,main,George,0,0,0,,Boy, I sure would love a drink right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:48.73,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.09,0:08:49.93,main,George,0,0,0,,The juice...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:53.10,main,George,0,0,0,,Today's gonna be my last \Nday at school, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.99,main,George,0,0,0,,If I don't take you up on that \Noffer now, I'll never...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.13,main,Emile,0,0,0,,I-I'll go buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:08:59.82,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:05.34,main,George,0,0,0,,Thanks. I feel a tiny bit better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.58,main,Damian,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:09.57,main,George,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:15.32,main,George,0,0,0,,I never ordered the most expensive \Ncaviar bowl you could get for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:19.23,main,George,0,0,0,,Who knows how I'm going \Nto end up from the regret
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.23,0:09:22.30,main,George,0,0,0,,of not being able to eat it \Nbefore I'm as good as expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:37.02,main,George,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I've always wanted to know what \Nit feels like to have a Stella on my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:39.51,main,George,0,0,0,,Will someone lend me theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:40.86,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You little—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:44.63,main,George,0,0,0,,I was working really hard \Nto earn a Stella myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:49.28,main,George,0,0,0,,But I couldn't concentrate on my studies \Nafter hearing about the bankruptcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.63,0:09:54.85,main,George,0,0,0,,I know it's unfounded, but my grudge \Nagainst the Desmonds is taking control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:59.97,main,George,0,0,0,,Ah! Someone take a photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:01.27,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Give it right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:03.14,main,George,0,0,0,,Okay, next...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:06.20,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get ahead of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:11.15,main,George,0,0,0,,Around this time next month, my family\N probably won't have a dalc to its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:16.51,main,George,0,0,0,,Then I'm probably going to get \Nkidnapped and trafficked to Westalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:20.01,main,George,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll have to live like a slave there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.97,main,George,0,0,0,,Oh, poor me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:26.51,main,George,0,0,0,,So let me just enjoy these \Nlast few moments of bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.51,0:10:29.48,main,George,0,0,0,,Am I so worthless that \NI don't even deserve that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Don't worry. The West is a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:39.27,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa and that important \Nlady are both really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:46.85,italics,George,0,0,0,,She doesn't know a thing about Westalis. \NIs she trying to console me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.34,italics,George,0,0,0,,Everyone's being so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:52.47,italics,George,0,0,0,,No one's ever been this kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:57.48,italics,George,0,0,0,,Huh? There's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.79,italics,George,0,0,0,,saltwater pouring out of my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:02.13,main,Student E,0,0,0,,George...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:05.29,main,George,0,0,0,,Can I ask for just one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:09.77,main,George,0,0,0,,I was really looking forward to the \Nchoral contest at the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:13.45,main,George,0,0,0,,I want to connect with all \Nof you through song.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:16.35,main,George,0,0,0,,Can I? That's probably \Nasking for too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:19.32,italics,Damian; Emile; Ewen,0,0,0,,Huh? We're also...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.74,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Becky... for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:36.27,main,George,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:00.73,italics,George,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:04.15,italics,George,0,0,0,,Thank you for such wonderful memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.77,0:12:15.86,main,Damian,0,0,0,,George.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:18.12,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Here, you can have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:20.98,main,Damian,0,0,0,,My own personal school supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:23.90,main,Damian,0,0,0,,They're super expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:27.98,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Even if you quit school, \Ndon't you forget about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:29.48,main,George,0,0,0,,Damian...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:32.89,main,George,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:36.25,main,Student F,0,0,0,,You can have my favorite book.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.76,main,Student G,0,0,0,,Here's my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.84,main,Student H,0,0,0,,Take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:43.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will give you this leaf she \Nfound on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.97,main,Student K,0,0,0,,Take care at your new school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.97,0:12:50.11,main,Student A,0,0,0,,The kids from Class 3 \Nwill always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:52.79,main,George,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:55.58,main,George,0,0,0,,I'll turn this pain in \Nmy heart into strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:57.89,main,George,0,0,0,,and continue to walk through \Nthis life full of hardships
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:13:00.67,main,George,0,0,0,,without ever giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.27,0:13:03.04,italics,George,0,0,0,,Goodbye, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:09.35,italics,George,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my beloved Eden!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.85,0:13:29.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So, yeah, that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:31.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What a lovely story!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:32.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.99,0:13:38.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But Glooman Pharmaceuticals just \Ngot bought out. It's not going bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:39.61,main,George,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:45.10,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,Our company was facing a financial crisis, \Nand the Desmond Group saved us from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:47.30,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,Management will change,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:51.61,main,George's father,0,0,0,,but they welcomed me and the \Nwhole research team with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:55.16,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,I couldn't be more grateful for \Nsuch a positive turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:59.82,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,Because I'll be losing my title as CEO and the\N Glooman Pharmaceuticals name will be lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:03.64,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,I was trying to figure out \Nthe best way to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:05.07,main,George,0,0,0,,Th-Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:09.65,main,George,0,0,0,,What about living in Westalis \Nas a slave? What about school?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:11.71,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,Hm? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:14.41,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,You'll continue going tomorrow as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:15.93,main,George's Father,0,0,0,,Have you finished your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:38.90,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You better give everything back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:41.43,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You better pay us back for that juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:07.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya, you need to get up, \Nor you'll be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:12.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Breakfast is ready, so go wash \Nyour face and get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:24.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I overslept!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:29.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's starting her morning in huge trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.71,0:15:32.08,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, stop talking with your mouth full.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:37.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you continue to be late and forget things,\N you'll continue getting punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:39.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If you end up with eight \NTonitrus Bolts, you'll be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:40.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:42.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-They're so strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:48.58,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank goodness she made it on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:51.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to head to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:52.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What about you, Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:56.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm only working half a day today, so I don't\N have to be at city hall until the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Then you'll be able to relax \Na bit. I'll be going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:03.50,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Have a good day. Do your best at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:15.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I see you got to sleep in a little today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:23.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please excuse me, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:32.98,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Did she forget something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:39.98,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Anya Forger! You will be expelled \Nfor forgetting something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:42.01,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:45.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Patooey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:50.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Miss Anya, you mustn't!\N Loid will be so sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:53.04,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:56.04,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't waste any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:58.58,italicstop,Yor,0,0,0,,I must deliver this to Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:17:01.00,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(465,285)\fscx48\fad(527,1)}MAMA BECOMES THE WIND
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:09.12,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Um... The bus stop is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:13.51,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's not a school bus, so I'll \Nhave to transfer somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:14.38,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:17.78,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But is the bus or the trolley faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.65,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:24.64,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Time just keeps passing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:29.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What will I do if I don't make \Nit in time for her gym class?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:37.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:57.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I do beg your pardon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:08.39,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:13.40,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:16.43,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But I wonder where Miss Anya is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:22.03,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I seem to recall her saying that each \Nlesson is in a different classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:25.71,flashback italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If you continue to be late and forget things,\N you'll continue getting punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:28.70,flashback italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If you end up with eight \NTonitrus Bolts, you'll be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:32.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's right! I have to keep the fact \Nthat she forgot something a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:37.26,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That means I won't be able to ask anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.01,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll have to find her on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:42.44,main,Students,0,0,0,,It turned out so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.04,main,Students,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.49,main,Students,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll show my mom when I get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:54.34,main,Student 1,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear about the \Nghost that appears in Tower B?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:57.53,main,Student 1,0,0,0,,The Mysterious Spider Woman. Hiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:19:01.32,main,Student 2,0,0,0,,You dummy. Of course \Nnothing like that exists...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.08,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\pos(-1,-46)\bord0\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H7D&\fad(523,1)}m 32 304 l 32 343 281 343 281 304
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.08,sign_32013_479_Stella_needed_to,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(39,277)\fs21\fscy125\fad(523,1)}* She's looking for Anya
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.09,0:19:09.70,main,student 2,0,0,0,,The Spider Woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.29,0:19:14.64,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be drawing attention to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:19.58,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Hmm... One wrong move \Nand I might be kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:22.34,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I know! Maybe I could wear a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:26.24,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Then I can look for Miss Anya without worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:27.18,main,Students,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:28.35,sign_7655_120_Biology_for_Good,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\an9}Biology for Good Boys and Girls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:27.94,main,Students,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.35,sign_7655_120_Biology_for_Good,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7}Foreign Languages
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:28.34,main,Students,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:28.35,sign_7655_120_Biology_for_Good,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\3c&HF9F7F6&}Language for Good Boys and Girls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:31.28,top,Students,0,0,0,,Please tell me how to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:31.84,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Um... Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.41,top,Students,0,0,0,,Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:31.84,top,Students,0,0,0,,Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:36.86,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,L-Let's not... There must be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:46.21,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh? These animals are the \Nones from the entrance exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:07.30,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'll be caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:10.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor? What's she doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:13.25,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Did she figure out I was actually using work
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:16.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,as a cover so I could infiltrate the school\N and decide to follow me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:18.32,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, that couldn't possibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:21.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? She seems to be holding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:27.67,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:35.79,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.31,0:20:38.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.49,0:20:39.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:44.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:47.72,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:50.46,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.91,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here, you forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:56.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:59.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Did I reach you before your gym class?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:02.89,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Is something the matter, Miss Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.89,0:21:06.40,main,Anya,0,0,0,,We don't have gym class today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:07.19,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:09.66,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So I don't need my gym clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:21.47,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:24.73,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's a good thing she didn't \Nactually forget anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.73,0:21:25.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:30.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,L-Loid? Didn't you go to the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:35.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I did. And after that, I went on a house \Ncall for a patient recovering at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:38.42,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:41.27,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:47.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. So you came to bring something \Nyou thought Anya had forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:49.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:51.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I was wondering what was going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:54.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but I guess I didn't need to \Nactually run into her to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:59.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no... I just had the wrong \Nidea and wasn't of any use anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:02.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If I had only checked her schedule...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.95,0:22:04.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm a failure as a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.81,0:22:05.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:09.91,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If Yor continues to be depressed, \Nit'll affect the mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:10.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:15.86,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I was thinking of having lunch somewhere \Nbefore heading back to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:19.42,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Would you care to join me, Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:20.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:24.73,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There's actually a place nearby \Nthat has a wonderful lunch menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.73,0:22:26.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, how exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,255)\fscx58}INVESTIGATE THE GENERAL HOSPITAL\NDECIPHER THE PERPLEXING CODE
